step Zul'Mamwe
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Ride east to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine. The headhunters, berserkers and hunters roam the ruins.
  tip Ana'thek the Cruel (45) carries the Broken Armor for Speaking with Gan'zulah: he walks the south-western ruins with two guards and sometimes stands in a small cave there. Pull the guards first.
  tip Careful: Mogh the Undying, an elite troll (level 44), stands in the southern ruins around 47.7,44.3: pull the headhunters and berserkers away from him.
  kill 669 quest 586.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Skullsplitter Hunter walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 781 quest 586.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 783 quest 586.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 3909 quest 586.4 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Ana'thek the Cruel; below ground

