step Pirate ghosts and Zanzil's camps
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip On south-west to the jungle north-east of Mistvale: the three ghostly pirates haunt it beside Zanzil's camps. Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east. Every one of Zanzil's followers can carry the mixture.
  tip Careful: the Zanzil Witch Doctors (44) cast and the camps are packed: pull from the edge, one at a time. Zanzil the Outcast (46) himself stands in the southern camp around 39.6,58.6, a few steps from Chucky's ghost: pull Chucky out to the north or east before you fight him.
  kill 2537 @40.0,58.2
  kill 2535 @35.3,51.3
  kill 2536 @34.9,51.8

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 35.3,60.4 "Stranglethorn Vale"

step Witch Doctor Unbagwa
  when onquest 348
  tip Careful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then Mokk the Savage. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy.
  collect 2799 x10                    -- Gorilla Fang
  turnin 349                   -- Witch Doctor Unbagwa, inside Spirit Den

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip In Booty Bay: Privateer Bloads on the docks, Fin Fizracket by the inn, Crank Fizzlebub inside it, MacKinley, Kebok and Krazek upstairs.
  turnin 209 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Kebok, upstairs
  accept 2864 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Krazek, upstairs: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan, later in this guide

step The Wild Shore
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents and in the rowboat beside the larger camp. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both.
  kill 1563 quest 604.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 3920 quest 604.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 3921 quest 604.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Booty Bay
  tip Back into town. The ships' captains, Seahorn's next request, are for your Stranglethorn stop at about 50.
  turnin 604 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Fleet Master Seahorn

